<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Scope: {{index .Data "scope"}}<br>Model: {{index .Data "model_code"}}<br>Commission: {{index .Data "commission_rate"}}% ({{index .Data "commission_payer"}})<br>Valid from: {{index .Data "valid_from"}}{{if index .Data "valid_to"}}<br>Valid to: {{index .Data "valid_to"}}{{end}}</p>
